        "text": "Extract all text from this PDF exactly as it appears, without summarizing or rewriting anything.\n\nPreserve:\n- All mathematical expressions\n- All equations\n- All factorizations\n- All numeric patterns like 2 × 3 × 7 × 11 × 23\n- All inequalities and conditions such as 0 ≤ r < b\n- All exponents such as 4ⁿ, 2²ⁿ, 2³, etc.\n\nDo not add any interpretation, extra explanations, or derived equations.\n\nDo NOT add citations, links, or metadata.  \nOnly return the extracted text.\n",
